    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree traversal</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree views</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/boundary-of-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 545</a> <span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Boundary of Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Split the boundary into four disjoint parts and print them in anti-clockwise order: the root, the left edge without its leaf, every leaf left to right, and the right edge without its leaf, reversed. Excluding leaves from both edge walks is what stops nodes from being printed twice. O(n) time, O(h) space.</p>\n"
  },
